					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "COLLECTIONS\n\nLook at you, tiger! This is your first followup tutorial.\nIn the fundamentals course we introduced you to the concept of instances and collections.\n\nIn this tutorial you'll learn how to create collections and use them.\nThis will open up new creative avenues, shrink the size of your patches and speed up your workflow. "
					}
				},
